{
 "version": 1,
 "about": "NLM-1 D2/D3.1 GENERALISATION set — written by the nlm1 track AFTER AUDIT's sealed-set categories (no sealed texts seen): (a) in-plan multi-step, (b) quantifier / position follow-ups, (c) revert follow-ups, (d) additive follow-ups, (e) removal by position, (f) Undo after a follow-up removal. Same format and gates as workflows.json (final workspace state + Undo, modelTurns 0). `canonical`: the scripted plan a correct planner would return for a step no deterministic reader takes (NLM1_WF_MODE=planner). NLM1_WF_MODE=planner replays each step that has a canonical plan with that plan as the model answer (faithful, through the real panel) and checks the step routes against routing v2: it separates no-deterministic-reader from wrong routing / binding.",
